{"3679190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chernobots", "steam_appid": 3679190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>CHERNOBOTS</strong></i></u> is a retro 3D roguelite, allowing endless exploration of the dangerous and procedurally generated Chernobyl Exclusion Zone following the nuclear power plant disaster. Search for highly radioactive targets that are top priority for removal. Drive and operate remote controlled robots equipped with cameras, radiation detectors, adjustable arms, deployable traps and more to get the job done. Avoid being destroyed by mutated animals or pay the price. Earn money for completing tasks and upgrade your robotics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>RETRIEVE TOP PRIORITY RADIOACTIVE TARGETS FOR REMOVAL</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/07621d0a615bb71247114f328f93d61b.poster.avif?t=1787752031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/07621d0a615bb71247114f328f93d61b.webm?t=1787752031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/07621d0a615bb71247114f328f93d61b.mp4?t=1787752031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE various PROCEDURALLY GENERATED areas within the CHERNOBYL EXCLUSION ZONE following the NUCLEAR POWER PLANT DISASTER: Pripyat City, Red Forest, and Power Plant locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEARCH areas that are different every 